# Affix rules with conditions, strip text, continuation classes, cross
# products, the blocking flags and morphological fields.
SET UTF-8
TRY esianrtolcdugmphbyfvkwzESIANRTOLCDUGMPHBYFVKWZ'
NEEDAFFIX X
ONLYINCOMPOUND O
FORBIDDENWORD !
KEEPCASE K
CIRCUMFIX C
WARN W
FORBIDWARN
FULLSTRIP
IGNORE ­
ICONV 2
ICONV ’ '
ICONV ﬁ fi
OCONV 1
OCONV ' ’
MAXDIFF 1

PFX A Y 2
PFX A 0 re . sp:re
PFX A 0 un .

SFX S Y 4
SFX S y ies [^aeiou]y is:pl
SFX S 0 s [aeiou]y is:pl
SFX S 0 es [sxz] is:pl
SFX S 0 s [^sxzy] is:pl

SFX D Y 3
SFX D 0 ed [^ey] is:past
SFX D 0 d e is:past
SFX D y ied [^aeiou]y is:past

SFX G Y 2
SFX G e ing/S e ds:ing
SFX G 0 ing/S [^e] ds:ing

SFX L N 1
SFX L y ily/S y ds:ly

PFX P Y 1
PFX P 0 ge/C .

SFX T Y 1
SFX T 0 t/C .

SFX Z Y 1
SFX Z 0 er/XS .

SFX Y Y 1
SFX Y 0 s/O .

SFX F Y 1
SFX F abc xyz abc

SFX M Y 1
SFX M 0 's . is:poss

SFX E N 1
SFX E 0 0 . is:same
